WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:03.830
For the sake of ending it all,

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:07.190
I have soaked this hand
in the essence of life.

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:10.960
It has claimed so many lives already,

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:14.160
yet it's grasping for more.

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:27.000
Who is he?

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.370
He's my friend.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:32.480
An important one.

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.320
Bring him along.

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:06.150
So the info I got was correct.

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.610
They've finally started.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:11.430
I wonder if they're all right.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:37.990
Looks like the civil war has started.

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:13.150
Distractions day after day, it's always something

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:13.150
Meutsuri Shiteru Hibi Are Kore

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:17.290
and no one has even realized that

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:22.310
I see the crimson trailing down your cold skin

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:22.310
Awadatsu Hada wo Tsutai Ochiru CRIMSON

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:26.500
Why do you want another punishment?

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:26.500
Why do you want Atarashii Batsu wo

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:31.250
The sweet fragrances that are drifting about

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:31.250
Tadayou Amai Kaori wo Tada

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:35.810
I just want to leave them be

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:35.810
Asobasete Itai Dake Nano sa

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:43.490
Someone hurry up and shoot me

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:43.490
Dareka Boku wo Hayaku Uchinuite yo

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:48.640
Show me a gunshot strong enough to make a hole

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:48.640
Show me Kantsuushita Juusou Ana ga Aku Hodo

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:53.110
I crush my thorny grip

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:53.110
Toge Darake no GRIP Nigiritsubushite

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:58.880
and load bullets that look like ripe flowerbuds

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:58.880
Osanai Mada Tsubomi no You na Dangan de

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.990
Let me shoot through the soul

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.990
Let me, shot through the soul

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:07.940
and dye it rose

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:07.940
Bara-iro ni Somare

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:43.320
How long are you going to
keep standing like that?

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:17.920
Well now.

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:20.770
Il Re and Nicole Premier
are fighting one-on-one.

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:23.020
This'll be interesting.

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:25.020
What a wonderful discovery you made.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.920
Nicole Premier is something else.

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:39.030
A real living weapon.

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:42.870
Shiki can't even make a
single scratch on him.

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:44.890
Truly wonderful.

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:48.560
That's so not like Shikky.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.800
Ain't his opponent the strongest of them all?

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:55.690
Lemme kill that dude next.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:58.100
Ya think you could do something against him?

00:04:58.100 --> 00:04:59.830
What the fuck?!

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.510
Ya picking a fight, geezer?

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:02.050
Huh?

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:05.520
You guys will be fine just protecting me.

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:07.660
Okay okay.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:09.030
I guess so.

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:19.740
Why aren't you fighting?!

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:21.700
Are you just playing with me?

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:25.960
What's your goal?

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:30.960
What's your intention?

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:39.260
When destruction is upon them,

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:44.550
the souls drunk in foolishness
retreat to the bliss of ignorance.

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:46.640
Don't be so arrogant!

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:48.560
Arrogant?

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:52.090
I merely speak of the source
of all this nonsense.

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:55.530
Life.

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:56.760
Nature.

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:58.070
Civilization.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:05.260
If you live longer than all three, you
see them reduced to ugly lumps of desire.

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:16.290
Humans are weak.

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:19.680
Therefore, I shall rise above them.

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:23.660
I will take what I look down upon for myself

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:28.640
and capture all in my illusion.

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:30.610
But power is real!

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:37.510
The recklessness of a lone person gives birth to
struggle which in turn is made of many sacrifices.

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:38.910
Power is absolute!

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:43.360
In that case, why do you seek me?

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:53.540
Back then... Why didn't you kill me?

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:27.260
Tell me why you didn't kill me.

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:36.390
That feeling of dread
that was born within you.

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:39.940
I wanted to feel it.

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:41.400
What?

00:08:42.920 --> 00:08:45.750
I saw it within you back then.

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:51.580
The fear that was born and
tormented you from within.

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:53.930
And the urge you felt.

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:56.330
It would certainly come back to you later.

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:04.510
Haven't you struggled enough?

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:14.820
Can Shikky really do it?

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.160
Let's go back.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.690
What are you talking about?

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:24.450
If no one interferes, he can carry on alone.

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:26.610
And who wins...

00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:29.660
Well, we'll see.

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:32.700
Die!

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:47.690
Those who cannot win keep challenging me

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:50.430
despite the fact that they will be defeated.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:55.240
You've tasted nothing so far,

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:59.590
but I can sense your fear.

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:00.950
Damn you!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.780
Are you trying to become God or something?

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:08.610
You can't obtain true strength because
you're unaffected by weakness.

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:10.120
Shut up!

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:18.440
What will you do when you feel pain?

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:22.550
And will you be able to stay strong?

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:24.520
What do you mean?

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:32.970
The blood streaming through my body
gives people the illusion of strength.

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:36.900
It is the symbol of your weakness.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.230
Do you understand?

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:42.850
Line is made by watering down my blood.

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:47.720
If a normal person were to take it undiluted,

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:51.160
they would go crazy or die.

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:56.060
Accepting this blood is a trial.

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:58.960
If you pass it...

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:00.970
Enough talking.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:02.810
Who do you think would take your blood?

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:06.460
I'm asking you if you can pass this trial.

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:16.390
If you wish for true strength,
accept the weakness within you.

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:18.640
Just like I did.

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:24.820
What will you do?

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:33.490
I've cut down everything
for the sake of power.

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:39.460
I will do it.

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:06.610
You really are a fool.

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:31.740
No way.

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:32.720
That's suicide!

00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:35.430
Is Shikky gonna drop dead?

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:38.610
That's 100% pure Line.

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:42.140
I can't even imagine what the
reaction to that feels like.

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:20.680
Looks like he croaked.

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:23.240
I knew it was hopeless.

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:39.780
Oh?

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:56.740
Impossible!

00:13:56.740 --> 00:13:59.370
Did he really take it?

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:33.040
Come out!

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:34.050
Don't even try to hide!

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:37.980
D-Don't shoot!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:39.470
We won't do anything!

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:40.610
Please!

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:41.990
Don't shoot us!

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:43.600
Please save us!

00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:58.570
Is someone there?

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:10.900
Shoot!

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:13.200
Over there!

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:16.670
Damn it!

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:28.430
End of the line!

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:36.400
Keisuke!

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:52.690
Keisuke...

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:58.510
My body just kinda moved on its own
when I thought you were in danger.

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:01.510
Are you all right now?

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:04.610
I guess I slept for a long time.

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:06.260
My body feels light now.

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.190
Anyway, we can't stay here.

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:13.190
Let's move!

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:29.380
Are these army people here
to kill everyone in Toshima?

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:30.800
Yeah.

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:33.320
Do you think Rin and Motomi are all right?

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:36.940
Hurry up. The church is
right past that street.

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:51.310
Null Nicole.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:53.310
Shiki!

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:57.940
"Those who cannot win keep challenging me

00:16:57.940 --> 00:16:59.860
despite the fact that they will be defeated."

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:01.320
What?

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:05.390
"You've tasted nothing so far,

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:09.280
but I can sense your fear."

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:10.990
What are you saying?

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:14.340
Stay back, Keisuke.

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:16.600
Come with me.

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:24.080
Come!

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:37.470
Don't defy me.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:05.330
Keisuke.

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:08.910
Keisuke!

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:15.510
Akira...

00:18:17.060 --> 00:18:18.080
Run.

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:21.510
Don't be stupid!

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:23.010
How could I leave you behind?

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:25.890
It's all right.

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:28.030
Run.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:33.260
Will I be able to get through
this with your blood?

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:49.850
You've lost.

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:52.830
I've surpassed you.

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:57.080
But you've lost to yourself.

00:18:57.440 --> 00:19:03.190
You accepted my blood in order to gain
victory over the fear within you.

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:12.440
I've surpassed both myself and you.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:30.100
Keisuke!

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:30.880
Keisuke!

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:33.100
Akira...

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:35.750
We can get out of here soon!

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:36.680
I'll save you!

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:38.680
Yeah.

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:41.950
Stay with me, Keisuke!

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:44.250
Don't give up!

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:45.980
Rin and Gramps are waiting!

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:51.410
Keisuke!

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:57.040
There's something I really
wanted you to know...

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:58.060
Don't talk!

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:02.550
I wanted to be useful to you.

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:05.780
I wanted to do anything for you.

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:07.380
That's why I took Line.

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:09.200
I know.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:10.840
I know! Please don't talk!

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.800
But in the end I just caused you pain...

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:15.800
I'm sorry...

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:21.960
I did so many bad things.

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:26.040
I killed so many people.

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:30.100
Please don't try to talk anymore...

00:20:33.590 --> 00:20:35.790
I'm glad you're safe.

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:38.980
I wanted to be together forever.

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:55.930
No Keisuke, don't!

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:42.100
Keisuke...

00:21:44.980 --> 00:21:46.160
Keisuke.

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:49.900
Keisuke.

00:21:50.940 --> 00:21:52.290
Keisuke.

00:21:54.150 --> 00:21:57.610
KEISUKE!

00:22:12.020 --> 00:22:18.850
Everything now ruthlessly torn apart

00:22:21.460 --> 00:22:27.280
All the things once I had are gone

00:22:30.860 --> 00:22:37.420
Can’t you hear, the dark blades of the night

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:45.480
Craving for that wound you’ll bleed

00:22:46.780 --> 00:22:50.450
Lost of all tears

00:22:52.350 --> 00:22:56.170
My sight blinded with faith

00:22:58.690 --> 00:23:04.060
Lost voices call in pain

00:23:04.220 --> 00:23:06.420
Nothing answers

00:23:06.420 --> 00:23:08.740
Still I remember

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:10.850
Still I see (yeah)

00:23:10.850 --> 00:23:17.740
Awoken in the scorched out land of grief

00:23:19.010 --> 00:23:21.720
And yet something grows within

00:23:24.850 --> 00:23:27.060
Stretch out, ignite the light

00:23:27.060 --> 00:23:29.010
Can I still believe?

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:31.580
The amber sunset

00:23:31.720 --> 00:23:36.050
The brown soil lullabys

00:23:36.610 --> 00:23:41.330
Green leaves on your skin

00:23:42.510 --> 00:23:45.720
Still I see

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:54.800
I thought death was something beautiful.

00:23:54.800 --> 00:23:59.920
Your heart will stop beating, you'll stop
breathing, and you'll fall asleep for eternity.

00:23:59.920 --> 00:24:04.910
That's all I thought about it.

00:24:01.840 --> 00:24:04.460
Episode 12
